B.aqa=new A.bT(B.pX,null,B.an,"Creator codes","Heard a code in a video? Type it in Settings \u2192 Have a code? and Pro costs less. The Pro screen shows the code, the regular price struck through and the one you actually pay.",!0)
B.aeH=s([B.aqa],t.e)
B.aqp=new A.f9("1.18.0","25 SEP 2026","A code from a creator you follow now lowers the price.",B.aeH)
B.a1H=new A.b3(62754,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aqi=new A.bT(B.a1H,null,B.aT,"An account, in Settings","Sign in with Apple, Google or an email \u2014 from Settings, never from the door. Your Pro licence is tied to it and shows up on any phone you sign in on.",!1)
B.aq6=new A.bT(B.pX,null,B.an,"Promotional codes","A new card in Settings takes a code and unlocks Pro on your account. One code per account; it needs no store and follows you like a purchase.",!1)
B.a1I=new A.b3(62885,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.apZ=new A.bT(B.a1I,null,B.as,"One account, one person","Signing in now ties this phone to your account, so your history is one history instead of one per device.",!1)
B.apS=new A.bT(B.lF,null,B.cP,"Reminders that actually arrive","The switch was on out of the box but your phone had never been asked, so nothing was ever delivered \u2014 Improvy did not even appear under Notifications in your phone\u2019s settings. It now asks after your second really good round, and the card in Settings says so and offers the fix whenever your phone is blocking them.",!1)
B.aqf=new A.bT(B.wW,null,B.bp,"Every tier bites again","A few thousand answers in, the app was getting finished. A question now gives 5s at Apprentice instead of 6, 2.24s at Virtuoso instead of 3.2, and 1.02s at Master instead of 1.2. Still room to work an interval out by hand, and no more.",!1)
B.wM=new A.b3(63282,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.apB=new A.bT(B.wM,null,B.bo,"The mode card tells the truth","Score 49/50 at chromatic Master and the diatonic card said 0%. It now shows what that run proved \u2014 97% at Apprentice \u2014 while the BEST line stays what you actually scored there. The animal on each card follows the same rule.",!1)
B.a8p=s([B.aqi,B.aq6,B.apZ,B.apS,B.aqf,B.apB],t.e)
B.aqD=new A.f9("1.17.0","11 SEP 2026","Pro follows you now, not your phone.",B.a8p)
B.wZ=new A.b3(983737,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aqe=new A.bT(B.wZ,null,B.as,"Twelve widgets on iPhone","There were none. The widget extension had never been added to the iOS project, so nothing Improvy wrote ever reached a home screen. All twelve are there now: the hourly question, the daily, the key map, your level, the streak, the weakest key and the rest.",!1)
B.aq1=new A.bT(B.ft,null,B.aE,"A design, not a dark rectangle","Every widget wears its own accent \u2014 a glow from the top corner and an edge to match \u2014 so a home screen of them reads as separate things. The key map fills each of the twelve tiles by how well you know that key.",!1)
B.wS=new A.b3(983159,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aql=new A.bT(B.wS,null,B.uy,"The widgets draw the real animal","The level widget showed an emoji where the app draws its own line art. It draws the same animal now, in the level\u2019s colour \u2014 and the empty squares elsewhere are gone: they were characters set in a font that has no glyph for them.",!1)
B.apF=new A.bT(B.q1,null,B.aT,"Widget taps arrive somewhere","On some phones every tap opened a second copy of the app on top of the first, on the home screen, whatever had been pressed \u2014 one line in the manifest meant it could never find the app already running. Taps land in it now, on the screen they name.",!1)
B.wT=new A.b3(983269,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aqd=new A.bT(B.wT,null,B.ao,"Pocket Mode speaks Italian all the way through","The sixth degree and D flat had never been recorded, so an Italian session said those two words in English \u2014 about one question in eight. Both are recorded now.",!1)
B.a2f=new A.b3(983571,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aps=new A.bT(B.a2f,null,B.aO,"A real app on iPad","Every screen here is drawn for a phone held upright, and an iPad was getting all of it stretched to 1024 points wide. The app now keeps to a centred column of phone width, and stays portrait.",!1)
B.apY=new A.bT(B.lG,null,B.ao,"The last English left over","The widgets speak your language now, and so do the bits the app had missed: the daily challenge rule, the streak in days, the game counts in Statistics.",!1)
B.apO=new A.bT(B.pY,null,B.oC,"Your week, in seven dots","The streak widgets now show the last seven days, not just the count \u2014 and the whole card turns gold on the day you are about to break one.",!1)
B.acs=s([B.aqe,B.aq1,B.aql,B.apF,B.aqd,B.aps,B.apY,B.apO],t.e)
B.aqE=new A.f9("1.16.0","4 SEP 2026","The home-screen widgets, rebuilt \u2014 and on iPhone, built at all.",B.acs)
B.a1T=new A.b3(63249,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aq_=new A.bT(B.a1T,null,B.aE,"Three bars, not one average","Each key in Statistics now shows Degree to Note, Note to Degree and \u2026Of What? separately, so a single number can never hide which of the three you have actually built.",!1)
B.a23=new A.b3(63679,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.apK=new A.bT(B.a23,null,B.ao,"The summary reports what moved","After a session you see the family you just played and the key overall \u2014 and Note to Degree and \u2026Of What? get that card too, now that they keep records of their own.",!1)
B.aqh=new A.bT(B.lG,null,B.aO,"One name per mode, in every language","Note to Number, \u2026Of What?, Pocket Mode and the rest keep their names whatever language the app is in. Everything around them still follows your phone.",!1)
B.aq4=new A.bT(B.hA,null,B.an,"Pocket Mode says nothing it cannot know","The key tiles no longer carry a mastery bar. Pocket Mode never sees your answer, so it has nothing to measure \u2014 an empty bar was only ever telling you off for nothing.",!1)
B.a25=new A.b3(983105,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.apI=new A.bT(B.a25,null,B.as,"A prettier walkthrough","The three opening screens each have their own colour, and the keyboard on them sits in a rounded bed instead of being cut off at the edges.",!1)
B.a6G=s([B.aq_,B.apK,B.aqh,B.aq4,B.apI],t.e)
B.aqn=new A.f9("1.15.0","3 SEP 2026","Every mode you play now counts, and you can see exactly where.",B.a6G)
B.a1W=new A.b3(63357,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aq5=new A.bT(B.a1W,null,B.as,"A file picker, and only that","Choosing a backup file used the same component that picks photos and videos, so the app looked like it wanted your camera roll. It now opens documents and nothing else.",!1)
B.a8m=s([B.aq5],t.e)
B.aqF=new A.f9("1.14.1","1 SEP 2026","Restoring a backup no longer asks the phone for more than it needs.",B.a8m)
B.apC=new A.bT(B.jv,null,B.aE,"A keyboard you can move","The numbers sit on the keys. Change the key and watch the letters move while the numbers stay \u2014 that is the whole idea of the app, in one tap.",!1)
B.apX=new A.bT(B.q1,null,B.ao,"Answer one before you start","The last screen is a real question, with the key lighting up when you get it. Nobody reaches the home screen without having played.",!1)
B.ado=s([B.apC,B.apX],t.e)
B.aqs=new A.f9("1.14.0","1 SEP 2026","The first three screens now show the idea instead of describing it.",B.ado)
B.apV=new A.bT(B.lG,null,B.as,"Italian, Spanish, French, German, Portuguese","The whole app follows your phone\u2019s language. Musicians who write Do Re Mi get that notation from the first screen, and Pocket Mode already speaks Italian.",!1)
B.aco=s([B.apV],t.e)
B.aqt=new A.f9("1.13.0","1 SEP 2026","Improvy now speaks your language.",B.aco)
B.a2k=new A.b3(983659,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.apG=new A.bT(B.a2k,null,B.as,"Export and restore","Settings \u2192 Backup writes one file with every key, score and setting. Reinstall or change phone \u2014 restore it and everything is back.",!1)
B.a1G=new A.b3(62747,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aqj=new A.bT(B.a1G,null,B.ao,"Larger type, and a screen reader that makes sense","The app now follows the system text size up to 130%, and keys, answer buttons and switches announce what they are.",!1)
B.afN=s([B.apG,B.aqj],t.e)
B.aqA=new A.f9("1.12.0","31 AUG 2026","Your progress can leave the phone, and the app can be read aloud.",B.afN)
B.apU=new A.bT(B.ef,null,B.as,"Every right answer sounds","Name the \u266d3 of A and you hear it. The ear learns alongside the number \u2014 switch it off in Settings for quiet places.",!1)
B.apM=new A.bT(B.q0,null,B.aE,"What a degree is, before the first question","Three short screens after the welcome: the numbers, why they work in every key, and what the game asks. Skippable if you already know.",!1)
B.apA=new A.bT(B.wM,null,B.ao,"The summary tells the truth",'"Level passed" now means the next tier is actually open \u2014 the same 80% bar the rest of the app uses \u2014 and a free player who finishes a key is shown the half they have not seen.',!1)
B.afi=s([B.apU,B.apM,B.apA],t.e)
B.aqB=new A.f9("1.11.0","31 AUG 2026","Hear the note you just named, and a proper start for newcomers.",B.afi)
B.a1Z=new A.b3(63480,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.apu=new A.bT(B.a1Z,null,B.ao,"A bar under every key","Pick a key in Note to Number or \u2026Of What? and each one carries a small bar: filled as far as you have taken it, empty for the rest. Twelve keys read like twelve columns, and the one you select says its exact figure at the top.",!1)
B.ac_=s([B.apu],t.e)
B.aqr=new A.f9("1.10.5","30 AUG 2026","Every key shows how far you have taken it, at a glance.",B.ac_)
B.aqk=new A.bT(B.wL,null,B.cz,"The key ranking means something","It ranked by raw accuracy over all history, which rewarded not climbing: a key dabbled with at six seconds outranked one taken to Master. It now ranks how often you answer right inside 1.2 seconds \u2014 either you know where the \u266d3 is or you are counting.",!1)
B.a2c=new A.b3(983477,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aq9=new A.bT(B.a2c,null,B.as,"Response time, not accuracy over time","Accuracy fell off a cliff the day you unlocked a harder tier, so the chart showed a decline for what was clearly progress. Speed has no such reversal \u2014 it only ever falls as you get better.",!1)
B.a1U=new A.b3(63317,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aqc=new A.bT(B.a1U,null,B.iW,"Each card reads the modes it is about","Degree Accuracy takes both directions over a key and leaves the harmonizer out. The keyboard heatmap takes everything, but one reading per session, so a long evening cannot drown a short one.",!1)
B.a7p=s([B.aqk,B.aq9,B.aqc],t.e)
B.aqx=new A.f9("1.10.2","30 AUG 2026","The statistics now measure what you would feel on a bandstand.",B.a7p)
B.apR=new A.bT(B.wS,null,B.b6,"Turtle is two sessions away","The eight levels used to be eight equal steps, set when a key counted one skill. The first ones are now close together and the last ones are a long climb \u2014 which is what their names always promised.",!1)
B.a2l=new A.b3(983776,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.apt=new A.bT(B.a2l,null,B.aE,"The two directions carry more weight","Reading a degree and naming the note, and its mirror, are 40% of a key each. Naming the key a note belongs to is rarer and more advanced, and is the remaining 20%.",!1)
B.ab8=s([B.apR,B.apt],t.e)
B.aqw=new A.f9("1.10.1","30 AUG 2026","The animals come faster now, and the harder ones cost more.",B.ab8)
B.a2m=new A.b3(984592,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aq2=new A.bT(B.a2m,null,B.aE,"Three skills, one number","Naming the note for a degree, naming the degree for a note, and naming the key a note belongs to. Each is a third of what it means to know a key, and the tile shows the three together.",!1)
B.a2j=new A.b3(983651,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.apT=new A.bT(B.a2j,null,B.an,"Your percentages will look smaller","Nothing was lost and nothing was reset. The scale got three times longer, so a key you had finished now reads 33% \u2014 and open it to see exactly which two thirds are left.",!1)
B.apE=new A.bT(B.wP,null,B.ao,"Every key explains itself","Key Analysis breaks the number into its three parts instead of the two it used to show, so the figure on the tile is never a black box.",!1)
B.adg=s([B.aq2,B.apT,B.apE],t.e)
B.aqz=new A.f9("1.10.0","30 AUG 2026","A key is now scored on all three ways of knowing it \u2014 so most of them just got a lot bigger.",B.adg)
B.a2d=new A.b3(983499,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aqg=new A.bT(B.a2d,null,B.ao,"One rule, three modes","Note to Number and \u2026Of What? are now scored like the main modes: half the score is knowing the core cold \u2014 the seven scale degrees, or the chord tones \u2014 and half is extending it to every degree.",!1)
B.apQ=new A.bT(null,"\u266f\u266d",B.as,"Chord and All keep their own records","\u2026Of What? used to pool both into one bar, so a run on the four chord tones filled the same dial as a run on all fifteen degrees. They are separate now, and your old scores stay where they belong.",!1)
B.aa0=s([B.aqg,B.apQ],t.e)
B.aqu=new A.f9("1.9.4","30 AUG 2026","Every mode is scored the same way now, and half of each one is free.",B.aa0)
B.a1K=new A.b3(62973,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.apx=new A.bT(B.a1K,null,B.aE,"A number that adds up","Chromatic contains the seven notes of the scale, and Master asks the same questions as Apprentice with less time. Your key percentage now takes both into account, so a hard run counts for the easier ones you never needed to play.",!1)
B.apN=new A.bT(B.wR,null,B.ao,"One bar to clear, and it is lower","Every tier now opens at 80% of the one below it \u2014 it used to be 90% for Virtuoso and 92.5% for Master, two different bars. And a key you have already proved opens its tiers straight away.",!1)
B.apz=new A.bT(B.hC,null,B.an,"Some keys just went up","Nothing you have done was lost \u2014 it was being counted wrongly. Nobody goes down, and a few keys jump a long way.",!1)
B.adl=s([B.apx,B.apN,B.apz],t.e)
B.aqv=new A.f9("1.9.3","30 AUG 2026","The percentage on a key finally counts everything you have already proved.",B.adl)
B.a1S=new A.b3(63189,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.apL=new A.bT(B.a1S,null,B.ao,"Every key shows its own progress","The outline of each key fills as you take it through the three tiers, in that key\u2019s own colour. Twelve keys, read at a glance.",!1)
B.a2e=new A.b3(983501,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.apw=new A.bT(B.a2e,null,B.aE,"The ladder reaches the other modes","Note to Number and \u2026Of What? keep your record for each key and each tier, and Master has to be earned through Apprentice and Virtuoso \u2014 the same rule the main modes have always had.",!1)
B.apv=new A.bT(B.fu,null,B.as,"Simpler setups, longer sessions","\u2026Of What? is now Chord or All, and its length comes from the tier instead of a separate list. Custom Mode builds any of the three directions, and both it and Pocket Mode run 30, 50, 100 \u2014 or until you stop.",!1)
B.a7j=s([B.apL,B.apw,B.apv],t.e)
B.aqo=new A.f9("1.9.1","21 AUG 2026","Note to Number and \u2026Of What? now remember what you did, and every key wears how far you have taken it.",B.a7j)
B.apH=new A.bT(B.wT,null,B.ao,"It speaks your notes","Set the note names to Do-Re-Mi and the voice switches to Italian as well \u2014 questions, keys and answers. What is on screen and what is in your ear are finally the same words.",!1)
B.aq0=new A.bT(null,"\u266f\u266d",B.iW,"A clearer English voice","Every note name re-recorded, from C to G double sharp. The numbers are unchanged.",!1)
B.a7A=s([B.apH,B.aq0],t.e)
B.aqm=new A.f9("1.9.0","21 AUG 2026","Pocket Mode now speaks Italian, and the English voice has been re-recorded.",B.a7A)
B.aq3=new A.bT(B.wN,null,B.iW,"Say it from inside the app","Settings, under Support. A box and a button \u2014 no mail app, no account, no name attached unless you write one. Leave an email only if you want an answer back.",!1)
B.a8x=s([B.aq3],t.e)
B.aqq=new A.f9("1.8.5","20 AUG 2026","There is now a place to tell us what is wrong with this app, and it does not need your email.",B.a8x)
B.X2=new A.u(1,0.8980392156862745,0.6627450980392157,0.23529411764705882,B.i)
B.apP=new A.bT(B.pY,null,B.X2,"A new challenge every day","Some days you name the note for a degree, some days the degree for a note, some days the root a note belongs to. Same run for everyone, whichever one it is.",!1)
B.apW=new A.bT(null,"\u266f\u266d",B.aT,"One spelling at a time","Train \u266d5 without \u266f4, or \u266f2 without \u266d3 \u2014 every spelling is its own button, and its own recording. The answer delay now goes down to 0.3 seconds.",!1)
B.apJ=new A.bT(B.wV,null,B.ao,"Note to Number is free","All twelve keys, diatonic, no Pro needed. It is the one direction where the buttons cannot hint at the answer, so it is the honest way to learn a scale.",!1)
B.apy=new A.bT(B.jv,null,B.dn,"The keyboard stops helping","Apprentice still lights the scale. Above it every key is live, so no question can be answered by counting \u2014 and Master takes the note names off, like a real piano.",!1)
B.apD=new A.bT(B.hA,null,B.ao,"Plays with the screen off","It kept stopping the moment the phone locked. It no longer does, so a walk really is a practice session.",!1)
B.ab9=s([B.apP,B.apW,B.apJ,B.apy,B.apD],t.e)
B.aqC=new A.f9("1.8.4","17 AUG 2026","The daily challenge now asks all three directions, and Pocket Mode lets you drill one spelling at a time.",B.ab9)
B.aqb=new A.bT(B.wZ,null,B.aT,"Widgets on your home screen","A question that changes every hour, the daily challenge, your streak, your weakest key \u2014 put any of them where you will see them.",!1)
B.aq8=new A.bT(null,"\u266f\u266d",B.aE,"Mastery, key by key","Twelve tiles showing where you actually stand, and a shortcut straight into the key you keep getting wrong.",!1)
B.aq7=new A.bT(B.hA,null,B.ao,"Pocket Mode speaks properly","A real recorded voice instead of a synthetic one, and the keyboard names every note the way your current key spells it.",!1)
B.a6a=s([B.aqb,B.aq8,B.aq7],t.e)
B.aqy=new A.f9("1.6.0","2 AUG 2026","Eleven home-screen widgets, a map of every key you have touched, and a paywall that finally behaves.",B.a6a)
